{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "input",
  "title": "IInput 输入框",
  "description": "用于带鼠标径向渐变悬停高亮效果的单行文本输入组件。",
  "category": "form",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "input",
    "aceternity-ui"
  ],
  "aliases": [],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "defaultValue",
      "type": "string | number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "非受控模式下的初始值，未绑定 v-model 时生效"
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "输入框本体的额外 CSS 类。"
    },
    {
      "name": "containerClass",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "外层渐变容器的额外 CSS 类，宽度等布局类通常设在此。"
    },
    {
      "name": "modelValue",
      "type": "string | number | null",
      "required": false,
      "description": "双向绑定值",
      "vModel": true
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "update:modelValue",
      "description": "modelValue 变化时触发（v-model 同步）",
      "payload": "(value: string | number | null | undefined)"
    }
  ],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/input/InputDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web",
      "code": "<template>\n  <div class=\"flex h-56 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n    <label\n      for=\"inputDemo\"\n      class=\"ml-4 w-full max-w-sm text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200\"\n      >Hover over below input</label\n    >\n    <IInput\n      id=\"inputDemo\"\n      placeholder=\"Hover over me\"\n      container-class=\"w-full max-w-sm\"\n    />\n  </div>\n</template>\n"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "登录、注册等营销感较强的表单需要悬停高亮输入框时。",
    "web 落地页表单想要跟随鼠标的径向边框效果时。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "常规业务表单或跨端场景，改用 reborn-input。",
    "需要占位文字消失动画的搜索框，改用 vanishing-input。",
    "多行文本输入，改用 reborn-textarea。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "组件名为 IInput（文件 IInput.vue），与 reborn-input 不是同一组件。",
    "样式分两层：class 作用于输入框本体，containerClass 作用于外层容器（宽度通常设在 containerClass 上）。",
    "Web 显式绑定 modelValue 为 undefined/null 时清空显示；仅未绑定时读写 defaultValue 起始的本地值。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add input"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
    "web": [
      "app/components/reborn/ui/input/IInput.vue",
